          "sigma": 8.0,
          "band_low": 0.5,
          "band_high": 1.5,
          "max_step": 1,
          "passes": 6,
          "color_index": 5,
          "node_note": "The stele is darker than the cortex around it (small cells, many walls). Its outline is searched all the way round, near the core found from cell sizes (first guess), and re-centred on itself: an off-centre stele is followed."
        }
      }
    },
